    "DSC006 demanded a pending model reload removed by the existing known-asset source fix; updated oracle observes prior/busy/photoLoaded transitions and checks geometry throughout.",
    "Hosted CI failed once on unavailable Auto Cancel; old generic MetaCall gate can intercept unrelated editor deliveries. Local old adapter passed 10/10 and did not reproduce the CI failure. Replacement holds the actual successful transform result, checks source/job identity, real Cancel, then exact once-only stale-revision rejection."
